  "bodyHash": "UwtRNd2JfJw=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5db75cde-773d-4709-ace4-d2517af73116.png\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vestiges-of-the-present\" width=\"204\" height=\"64\"></a></p><h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">支援模組：</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5;font-size:16px;display:inline !important\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvestiges.pyding.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/1fff64_c6708d3c3a52425d8ad4c3fc07220109~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vestiges-of-the-present\" width=\"82\" height=\"82\"></a></span></h2><h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://discord.gg/8HjGaRrMgf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 頻道</a></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">我的模組加入了來自未知強大生物的<span style=\"color:#f00\">挑戰</span>，你將透過劇情逐步探索其奧秘。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">挑戰</span>可與整合包中任何模組相容，並解決了模組包中最大的難題之一——平衡性。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">有些模組可能過於強大且廉價，有些則可能無用或有趣但需耗費大量時間。透過我的<span style=\"color:#f00\">挑戰</span>，兩者都將成為推進進度的必要元素，並以珍貴獎勵——<span style=\"color:#c9f\">遺跡</span>——賦予它們存在的意義。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">關於<span style=\"color:#c9f\">遺跡</span>的具體內容，你將在劇情中了解。簡言之，它們是強大的PVP與PVE工具，能達成其他模組無法實現的效果。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">模組物品列表：</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_1e2241e0-433f-4798-b052-681adb42a280.png\"></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1;font-size:36px\">遺跡範例：</span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#843fa1;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_fa1296ad-8638-4823-bd32-8abff215fdee.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_02b9a7eb-5caa-476b-a308-b3c8de8541c7.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_a6e132eb-79aa-4550-a523-e2a41d37bdf2.png\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">特色功能包含<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">全<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">球</span> <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">排<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">行</span></span>榜</span></span>（目前暫停更新），系統會納入所有遵守規則且具備網路連線的玩家。無論在單人遊戲或伺服器中，排行榜均可在任何世界存取！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_70c1659c-39d8-4831-b350-1f8fbb62dbf9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_28fbd10f-844d-4d7c-a08d-c1f2addc6510.png\"></p><hr><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">部分挑戰範例：（也可透過 NEI 按 Ctrl/Alt 檢視）</span></strong></span></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_8145639c-1563-4a16-bf2f-c9328ffd6098.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_ea4732ab-ee2b-47be-a3f6-4496208bbc3d.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_3bdeb334-5054-4585-922f-219f3325772b.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_4c0ffe8c-042e-450d-9351-2a1b56e41a16.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5e65600d-7624-4e55-85a6-717a3f477fb7.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">神<span style=\"color:#169179\">秘</span></span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">之</span>寶<span style=\"color:#eccafa\">箱</span></span>：</span></strong></span></span></h2><p>當你獲得進度或完成任一挑戰時，將有一定機率取得此寶箱。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5c7be93d-57b6-4d59-a3c3-1ce2ceb72b01.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_1661fff6-fd16-4b65-929f-2600e34cd177.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_a1b65202-5986-4052-a059-5353a641409a.png\"></p><hr><h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\">酷炫水下內容：</span></strong></span></span></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_c4dda327-1b02-4314-842c-8d5689cafe78.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_54f1fc51-14b7-4245-8ae9-7a61597caef0.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">還有殘酷模式？</span></strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">是的！只需輸入 /vestiges enableCruel，你就能體驗Boss應有的強度！（不僅是Boss，飢餓與溺水傷害也將變得無法抵擋，讓你無法憑藉華麗盔甲、被動天賦與魔法無視它們），怪物將有1%機率以強化型態生成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在此模式下，所有模組的Boss都將擁有4倍生命值與傷害、100點護甲值與護甲強度、90%傷害減免、基於生命值百分比的持續治療，以及<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9;text-decoration:underline\">護盾</span> </span>搭配<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#843fa1\">超護盾</span>！<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">護盾</span> </span>與<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">超護盾</span>可抵擋所有傷害，但兩者有何差異？請透過指令 /vestiges help 了解 :) 所有數值與Boss列表均可依需求自行設定。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，所有怪物都有極高機率穿著你的整合包中隨機生成的護甲，並有機會掉落強力物品。這些物品可賦予負面附魔效果，甚至突破其上限。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_d5b8ecba-f16b-40d9-a28f-e19b161a37cd.png\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_076e1513-e8e4-4d10-8636-659859f2ddfa.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_cf5a8aad-a8b8-4285-9366-dfe5bd58bcb9.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">如果某些Boss或怪物出現在挑戰中但無法召喚該怎麼辦？</span></strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以設定任何挑戰的最低完成門檻！所有挑戰元素仍會照常計算，挑戰將提前完成。</span></p><hr><h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">我的模組不僅包含遺跡</span></strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">還有<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">飾品</span>可為你提供多種加成 ^-^</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_5657ff26-af2f-49cd-9d31-392038e02744.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_095bb641-31ab-4fbf-9331-5c506c8bf286.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以透過這些取得它們</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_812f5c2f-09ff-4d4d-ba66-d15b3d290d5c.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f0f\">虛空漩渦</span></strong>可讓任何物品變得無法破壞</span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_9f4ddcc2-2ac3-4b61-a216-6b13826f4c4f.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">隨機箱子</span></strong>內含各種隨機物品</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_928ee246-a0cb-415a-8979-eebaa7161baf.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_52abdb4d-8a37-4354-8ec5-da491f8a7e59.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_0de9ace0-7d78-4d18-b708-cc419e2d9b11.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/971973/description_0e21bb8c-bf8c-4042-8714-b5d648939ef0.png\"></p><hr><h2><strong>此外，還有一個名為 vp-common.toml 的設定檔，你可以在其中調整許多內容！</strong></h2>",
